Recommends: yelp
Description: small and lightweight GTK text editor
 Xed is a GTK text editor with tabs, syntax highlighting, search and replace,
 remote file support, printing, and a plugin system. It is part of Linux
 Mint's XApps project.

Package: xed-common
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: architecture independent files for the Xed text editor
 Xed is a GTK text editor with tabs, syntax highlighting, and plugins.
 .
 This package provides translations, help files, icons, plugin data, and
 GSettings schemas.

Package: xed-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends:
 libgtk-3-dev,
 libgtksourceview-4-dev,
 libpeas-dev,
 xed (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: development files for the Xed text editor
 Xed is a GTK text editor with a plugin interface.
 .
 This package contains headers, pkg-config metadata, and GObject
 introspection data for developing Xed plugins.
